{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277500/extras/9e35a86633d57980084d124d68a2518f.poster.avif?t=1678990541\" width=480 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277500/extras/9e35a86633d57980084d124d68a2518f.webm?t=1678990541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277500/extras/9e35a86633d57980084d124d68a2518f.mp4?t=1678990541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a bone-chilling quest for vengeance as a fearsome, skull-hurling skeletal warrior in Skeletal Avenger! This captivating roguelite dungeon crawler melds hack'n'slash mayhem with endlessly replayable gameplay, offering a thrilling, ever-evolving experience that keeps you coming back for more.<br><br>In Skeletal Avenger, no two runs are alike. Each descent into the treacherous depths brings new opportunities to tailor your playstyle with powerful perks and upgrades. Embrace the chaos and forge a relentless path of destruction through an ever-changing underworld filled with bizarre, formidable foes.<br><br>The ultimate goal: vengeance. But to achieve it, you must first harness an arsenal of deadly weapons, master the art of bone-crushing combat, and outwit the unpredictable denizens of the dungeon's depths.<br><br>Dare to defy the odds and dive headfirst into the dark, immersive world of Skeletal Avenger. With every strike, swing, and skull-toss, you'll inch closer to reclaiming your honor and exacting retribution on those who wronged you. The time for revenge is now \u2013 will you seize it?<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build your playstyle each run with over 50 perks and trinkets!<br></li><li> Decapitate yourself to do special attacks: Your hat determines the effect<br></li><li> Fight in four 